        "created_at": "2018-04-23T17:54:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll have a set of papercraft standups for all the SotM heroes when OblivAeon comes out to use rather than the flat tokens when you're moving your heroes between battle zones.&nbsp; They won't be accurate for the Sentinels RPG timeline but it will be a complete set of heroes if you'd like to use them.&nbsp; So look for that when OblivAeon arrives (whenever that is).</p>",
